{"metadata": {"team_id": "TREMA_UNH", "run_id": "run_1-task-2", "topic_id": "msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_273997000", "type": "automatic", "use_starter_kit": 1}, "responses": [{"text": "On August 16, Citibank accidentally wired $900 million to Revlon lenders due to a clerical error (msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023"]}, {"text": "The error was reported by Zaini Majeed on August 17, 2020 (msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023"]}, {"text": "Citibank has appealed to Revlon for reimbursement, but the lenders have refused to return the funds (msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023"]}, {"text": "Three lenders, namely Brigade Capital Management, HPS Investment Partners, and Symphony Asset Management, have refused to pay back the $900 million (msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023"]}, {"text": "The lenders have also filed a lawsuit against the cosmetic firm, Revlon (msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023"]}, {"text": "The lawsuit is against Citibank as well, which was the administrative agent on the loan (msmarco_v2.1_doc_47_900269694#2_1940844801).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_47_900269694#2_1940844801"]}, {"text": "Citibank has now appealed for reimbursement from Revlon, who had largely been in default on its mortgages (msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023"]}, {"text": "The incident has plunged Citibank into a legal battle with Revlon, as it was unable to recoup any portion of the funds (msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#0_735757023"]}, {"text": "The legal battle between Revlon and its lenders over the $900 million payment is ongoing (msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#1_735759415).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_51_319264076#1_735759415"]}, {"text": "The lawsuit filed by the lenders against Citibank and Revlon is part of a broader legal dispute over the $900 million payment (msmarco_v2.1_doc_47_900269694#2_1940844801).", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_47_900269694#2_1940844801"]}]}
